# Used automatically by BuildKit for `docker build -f mp-spice/Dockerfile.reproduce`
# (a "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile overrides .dockerignore).
# Patterns are relative to the BUILD CONTEXT ROOT -- the directory that contains
# mp-spice/ and mtl5/, not this repo.
#
# Allowlist: send ONLY mp-spice/ and mtl5/ to the daemon. The context root is
# ~/Desktop/LFX, which may also hold a universal checkout and other large
# directories that would otherwise be uploaded on every build for nothing.
*
!mp-spice
!mtl5

# .git is deliberately KEPT (not listed below) so the builder can record commit
# SHAs and uncommitted changes in PROVENANCE.txt.
**/build
**/build-*
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store

# Large / regenerated, and fetched fresh in the image's own `matrices` stage:
mp-spice/data
# Not needed to use mtl5 as a header-only dependency:
mtl5/docs-site
mtl5/benchmarks
